17:23:
For the betterment of the life hereafter, Allah has prescribed some permanent values including: 
1. You should obey only Allah’s Laws;
2. You should make good the deficiencies of your old parents;
3. If one or both of them grow old, you should not prod or reproach them but speak to them respectfully (36:68);
4. You should give them protection with all the affection and say, “O my Rabb! (enable me) to provide them means of nourishment as they had raised me from childhood.”

